This personal repository rebuilds the legacy HttpSource/API 1.4 module at
commit d12e3b8a1eb5d7e5c7230f5b5b5854ba625a97dd, with versionCode incremented
from 1 to 2. The final JAR and APK use this personal repository's signing
certificate, rather than the upstream Keiyoushi signing certificate.

Repository scripts, tests, configuration, indexes, and workflows are also
licensed under Apache 2.0. No private signing key is included in this repository.

This project is not affiliated with MangaDash, Tachimanga, or Keiyoushi.
